// tools.memql -- the referencepack reference pack.
//
// One AI-callable tool that surfaces the pack's integration capability
// to an agent's tool loop. Its @handler points at the builtin in
// builtins.memql by name; the builtin in turn forwards to the Go
// capability "integration.referencepack.composeGreeting". So an agent
// calling `referencePackGreet` ultimately runs the pack's Go handler.
//
// This is the "one tool that surfaces the builtin/capability" half of
// the pack acceptance. The unified tool loader registers it into the
// engine's ToolRegistry alongside every core tool (proven by the
// load+extend test).

@enabled
@handler(type="function", name="referencePackComposeGreeting")
@executionTime("fast")
@description("Greet a user by name. Demonstrates a pack tool that surfaces a pack integration capability to the agent tool loop.")
tool referencePackGreet {
  userName  string  @required  @description("Name to greet.")
}
